        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Concrete roof tile, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Concrete roof tile, at plant
No losses and no waste water are taken into account.;
UUID: e3b70646-0e30-34ec-8839-274f5131fcb5
includes the raw material normal concrete which is poured into a mould, air-dried and packed. Some transports and infrastructure are also included.
Location: For some exchanges CH-, RER-, and GLO-datasets are used as proxy
Technology: typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e3b70646-0e30-34ec-8839-274f5131fcb5.xml</text>
